{"text": "The Office of Secretary of State\n\nBrian 2. Kemp\nSECRETARY OF STATE\n\nNovember 8, 2018\n\nThe Honorable Nathan Deal\n203 State Capitol\nAtlanta, Georgia 30334\nDear Governor Deal,\nhereby tender my resignation as Georgia\u2019s Secretary of State effective 11:59 a.m. on November\n8, 2018 to focus on the transition to my gubernatorial administration. Serving as Secretary of State\nhas been an honor. I look forward to serving as Georgia\u2019s 83\" Governor and building on the\nsuccess of your tenure as the leader of our state.\nSincerely,\n.\nA}\n\nBrian P. Kemp\n\nSwom to and subscribed before me\n\non this 3Y\u2122day of [Usvenber, 2018,\n\nNOTARY PUBLIC, Georgia\nMy Commission expires: NM@CCh le, 2024\n\n214 State Capitol -Atlanta, Georgia 30334 + (404) 656-2881 + (404) 656-0513 Fax\n\u2018wr w.sos.ga,g0",
